<div class="Section1">
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
text-transform:uppercase'><a href="/">Главная</a>
- ЕСТЕСТВЕННЫЕ
АЛЬБОМЫ
АКВАРИУМА И
БГ - ПЕСКИ
ПЕТЕРБУРГА - </span><span style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";text-transform:uppercase'>день
первый<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:red;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:red;layout-grid-mode:line'>ДЕНЬ
ПЕРВЫЙ</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><i><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Б.
Гребенщиков<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none"><i style="mso-bidi-font-style:normal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Каподастр
на 2-м ладу<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Проигрыш</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>: D - 4p.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  
</span>G<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                  
</span>A<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">               
</span>G<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span>D<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И был
день первый,
и птицы
взлетали из
рук твоих;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                 
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>A</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'> </span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                        </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И ветер
пах грецким
орехом, но не <span class="GramE">смел</span>
тронуть губ твоих,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">               
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>Em</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                 
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>A</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И
полдень
длился <span class="GramE">почти</span>
что
тринадцатый
час;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> 
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                   
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>A</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И ты
сказал слово,
и мне
показалось,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>D</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">             
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Что
слово было
живым;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">             
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>Em</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И
поодаль в
тени<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                   
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>A</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>Она
улыбалась,
как детям,
глядя на нас;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И после
тени домов
ложились под
ноги, узнав тебя,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И
хозяйки
домов
зажигали
свечи, зазвав
тебя;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И, как
иголку в
компасе, тебя
била дрожь от
их глаз;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И они
ложились под
твой прицел,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Не зная,
что видишь в
них ты,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Но
готовые
ждать,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Чтобы
почувствовать
слово ещё
один раз.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Проигрыш</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>: <span class="GramE">G A G D - 2p.</span> G Em A G A D G
Em G A G D<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Те, кто
любят тебя,
молчат -
теперь ты
стал лучше
их,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И твои
мертвецы
ждут внизу,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Но едва
ли ты
впустишь их;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И
жонглёры на
площади считают
каждый твой
час;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Но
никто из них
не скажет
тебе<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Того,
что ты хочешь
знать:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Как
сделать так,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Чтобы
она
улыбалась
ещё один раз?<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Заключение:
</span><span class="GramE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>
